# Chromatic Star's {1} is a mana ability's own mana cost, and which pool mana pays it is the player's choice
# (CR 602.2b via 601.2h). With {U}{B} floating either pays it, so the engine asks; Spend: B answers with the black,
# and the blue is kept beside the red the Star makes. The fixed rule would always have spent the blue.

